{"id": 999856, "slug": "chorus-of-carcosa", "name": "Chorus of Carcosa", "name_original": "Chorus of Carcosa", "description": "<p>Chorus of Carcosa is a psychological horror game inspired by the classic horror fiction of 'The King in Yellow' collection by R. W. Chambers. You play as a sculptor who is forced to abandon his place of comfort one night, when a blood-soaked neighbor knocks on his door.</p><h3>Experience the fear of facing the unknown </h3><p>Survive an ever-changing decrepit apartment building filled with dangers and mysteries... Without making a sound! Or THEY will hear you…</p><h3>Solve the mystery of an alternate reality</h3><p>A twisted realm fills the space around you. Are all of these changes real? Or are they just nightmarish hallucinations?</p><p> </p><h3>You can flee, but escape is an illusion</h3><p>They have found you and there's no turning back now. Perhaps, it’s sometimes wiser to embrace the surrounding madness and stare right back into its eyes.</p><h3>KEY FEATURES </h3><ul><li><p>Three hours of classic horror thriller gameplay </p></li><li><p>Endless tension — finding a way out is no easy task </p></li><li><p>Simple stealth mechanics — try to remain unnoticed when there’s no place to hide</p></li><li><p>Immersive graphics and high-quality 3D sound powered by Unreal Engine 5</p></li><li><p>Carefully written, directed, and voiced by professional actors</p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-03-20", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-03-21T10:37:00", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/abe/abecf38e8e1679b310095ad4ad9a1669.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/657/6576cd6b9368fed642c691a6707fe038.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 2, "added_by_status": {"beaten": 1, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 10, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 